<core:FragmentDefinition
  xmlns:core="sap.ui.core"
  xmlns="sap.m">
  <!--
    Issue #426 — the Path Items "Task" cell needs a value help that differs by
    row type: TUTORIAL -> Tutorials picker, GROUP -> Groups picker,
    CHECKPOINT -> free-text checkpoint title.

    Failed approaches (do NOT reintroduce — all verified broken 2026-07-27):
      * core:require handler (#1331/#1345): the module loads lazily and loses
        the race against FE's synchronous column-template clone on the DEPLOYED
        shell (admin child components ship without a Component-preload.js), so
        `handler` was unresolved at clone time -> showValueHelp expression
        degraded to a bare taskType path -> String coerced to Boolean ->
        FormatException -> no icon.
      * Native macros:Field with `visible` / VBox wrappers / multiple stacked
        Fields: FE allows exactly ONE building block per custom column cell;
        anything else throws "c?.isA is not a function" and blanks the object
        page. (macros:Field has no `visible` property.)

    Working approach (this file): a SINGLE sap.m.Input whose handlers resolve to
    methods on the BranchAnalyticsHandler controllerExtension (registered in
    manifest.json for sap.fe.templates.ObjectPage.ObjectPageController). FE
    instantiates controllerExtensions during OP component init — BEFORE it clones
    the LineItem column templates — so bare handler names (onTaskValueHelp,
    onTaskCheckpointChange) and the formatter (.formatTaskShowValueHelp) resolve
    deterministically, with no lazily-loaded module to race.

    showValueHelp uses a FORMATTER (raw String taskType -> Boolean return), NOT an
    expression binding over the Boolean property — so taskType is never coerced.
    editable uses IsActiveEntity, a genuine Boolean, so its coercion is a no-op.
  -->
  <Input
    value="{parts: [{path: 'taskType'}, {path: 'tutorial/title'}, {path: 'group/title'}, {path: 'checkpointTitle'}], formatter: '.extension.sap.tutorials.admin.missions.ext.BranchAnalyticsHandler.formatTaskDisplay'}"
    showValueHelp="{path: 'taskType', targetType: 'any', formatter: '.extension.sap.tutorials.admin.missions.ext.BranchAnalyticsHandler.formatTaskShowValueHelp'}"
    valueHelpRequest=".extension.sap.tutorials.admin.missions.ext.BranchAnalyticsHandler.onTaskValueHelp"
    editable="{= !${IsActiveEntity} }"
    change=".extension.sap.tutorials.admin.missions.ext.BranchAnalyticsHandler.onTaskCheckpointChange"
    placeholder="{path: 'taskType', formatter: '.extension.sap.tutorials.admin.missions.ext.BranchAnalyticsHandler.formatTaskPlaceholder'}"/>
</core:FragmentDefinition>
